{
  "dom_id": "step-9275",
  "name": "Example: \n                    Calculating the Surface Area of a Polyhedron Given the Areas of the Faces: Word Problems",
  "problem": "Maggy is building a pyramid from a cardboard net, shown below.  What will be the total surface area of the pyramid?  \n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14249141/assets/29c918514e60da13363883770befd9d80098deaba0b45cfcafa3255feb143261.png)",
  "worked_solution": "The net shown corresponds to a triangular pyramid. The surface area of our pyramid consists of $1$ triangular base and $3$ triangular sides.\n\nAdding the areas, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{Surface area} & =1\\times (\\text{Area of base})+3\\times (\\text{Area of side}) \\\\  & =1\\times 10+3\\times 12 \\\\  & =10+36 \\\\  & =46\\,{\\text{in}}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-9275\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"9275\" steptype=\"example\" contentid=\"2762\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    Example: \n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-9275\" class=\"stepAnchor\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\" name=\"step-5\">Calculating the Surface Area of a Polyhedron Given the Areas of the Faces: Word Problems</a> \n                </div>      \n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"9275\">?</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                <p>Maggy is building a pyramid from a cardboard net, shown below.  What will be the total surface area of the pyramid?  </p>\n<p><br></p>\n<div id=\"graphic-25b8cd579c4544b8df59da93a28b6eb0\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/25b8cd579c4544b8df59da93a28b6eb0\"></div>   \n            </div>     \n\n            <div class=\"explanationHeader\">EXPLANATION</div>\n\n            <div class=\"exampleExplanation\">\n                <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-w